title: EMR Connect › Field mappings › Every mapping by system
route: /emr
intro: The Field mappings table in the Manage drawer, system by system: what each of their fields fills in Psyflo, who mapped it, and which fields still wait. A newly connected system starts with none.
dir: TD
also: Seed data. 'Mapped by' reads 'Reader, 03/14' for the agents and 'You, {date}' for a person. Dates come from the Demo clock.
---
start s1 "Click 'Manage' on a system\nThen read the Field mappings card"
screen t0 "Field mappings\n'{n} mapped, {m} waiting'\nColumns: Their field, Fills, Mapped by"

group gRes "Residential site: 5 mapped"
  store r1 "Admit date fills 'Admission date'\nReader, 03/14"
  store r2 "Primary payer fills 'Payer'\nReader, 03/14"
  store r3 "Member ID fills 'Member ID (masked)'\nReader, 03/14"
  store r4 "Progress note fills 'Chart documents'\nReader, 03/15"
  store r5 "MAR fills 'Medication record'\nReader, 03/15"
endgroup

group gOut "Outpatient site: 3 mapped, 2 waiting"
  store o1 "Admit date fills 'Admission date'\nReader, 03/14"
  store o2 "Primary payer fills 'Payer'\nReader, 03/14"
  store o3 "Group note fills 'Chart documents'\nReader, 03/16"
  input w1 "'Level of care': Not mapped, button 'Map'\nChoices: IOP or PHP"
  input w2 "'Referral source': Not mapped, button 'Map'\nChoices: Payer name, Plan type or Referring provider"
endgroup

group gBill "Billing system: 2 mapped"
  store b1 "Claim number fills 'Claim reference'\nReader, 04/02"
  store b2 "Remittance date fills 'Payment date'\nReader, 04/02"
endgroup

group gNew "A system just connected"
  store n1 "0 mapped, none waiting\nThe table has a header and no rows"
endgroup

process c1 "A row mapped by a person goes at the end of that system's list\n'Mapped by' reads 'You, 10/20'"
doc d1 "Production: a versioned field map per record system, stored as data\nEvery canonical field shows its source. Changes carry a date and an author"
goto g1 "Continues in: EMR Connect › Needs a mapping › Map a field"

s1 --> t0
t0 --> r1 & o1 & b1 & n1
r1 --> r2 --> r3 --> r4 --> r5
o1 --> o2 --> o3 --> w1 --> w2
b1 --> b2
w1 --> c1
w2 --> c1
c1 --> g1
t0 -.-> d1
